  THE TWO CRITERIA DISAGREE, and that is a finding rather than a failure:
  magnitude says how much the state still moves, novelty says whether the
  movement is anywhere new.  A band that is absolute in magnitude and relative
  in novelty means the late steps keep their size while re-walking one
  direction -- write the NOVELTY band, since Z carries the pathway, not the
  displacement.

